            },
            "description": "Create a DRAFT sales order.\n\nPricing: if `unit_price` is omitted on a line, the service uses the item's catalog `unit_price` (the list price). Phase 1 has no per-customer pricing table.\n\nNo stock pre-check at create time - that's enforced at ship.\n\nErrors:\n- 404 CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND / ITEM_NOT_FOUND (also for inactive)\n- 409 DUPLICATE_LINE_ITEM"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /sales-orders",
