            "description": "Ship the SO - transactionally:\n1. Decrements items.stock_quantity for each line\n2. Inserts one stock_movements row per line (OUT, SALE)\n3. Flips status to SHIPPED, stamps shipped_date=today\n\nErrors:\n- 404 SALES_ORDER_NOT_FOUND\n- 409 SO_NOT_DRAFT - already shipped (state-boundary idempotency)\n- 409 INSUFFICIENT_STOCK - a line would push stock below zero. **Entire ship is rolled back** - no partial stock or ledger."
